/*——有bug的话，调💽的数值，💿是次选调动可顺便一起调了，✒️是可以自己改自定义文案。
建议使用美化区推荐的扩展插件或酒馆工具区的主题美化css实时编码搜关键词改动。

提示：渐变装饰在头像框（试过放装饰层三元素会被挡，暂时还没办法）

例子：上下 top：0px，正数数字-下移，负数数字-上移，反向思考即可。

代码成分很杂，是属于拼拼乐，除去一半自己肘的代码以外，其他代码有参考借用类名和使用了拼好码and一些小伙伴的代码。

不要二传商用，就算有人偷偷上闲鱼卖了其实我也知道，贩子是打不完的。
by：阿遥/Lyo——*/



/*字体*/
@import url("https://fontsapi.zeoseven.com/875/main/result.css");

body {

    font-family: "ChillHuoSong_F";

    font-weight: normal;

}

/*顶栏*/
#top-bar {
    position: fixed;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 99;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    overflow: visible;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    left: 0;
    right: auto;
}

#top-bar::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 5px;
    left: 0;
    right: auto;
    bottom: auto;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJVVDP.png');
    transform: scale(1.1) rotate(0deg) !important;
    background-size: auto;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: left top;
    border: 0px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
    border-radius: 0px;
    z-index: 9;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 9999px) {
    #top-bar {
        width: 100vw;
        height: auto;
        overflow: visible !important;
    }

    #top-bar::before {
        min-width: 100%;
        min-height: 100px;
        background-size: contain;
        background-position: center top;
    }
}


/*顶栏小装饰*/
#top-bar::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -80px; 
    left: 90%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 80px; /* 装饰宽度 */
    height: 80px; /* 装饰高度 */
    background-image: url(''); 
    background-size: contain;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center;
    z-index: 10000;
    pointer-events: none;
}


/*图标*/
#top-settings-holder .drawer-icon::before {
    content: '' !important;
    visibility: hidden; 
}

#top-settings-holder .drawer {
    flex: 1; 
}

/* 图标代码 */
#top-settings-holder .drawer-icon {
    display: block; 
    margin: 0 auto;
    background-size: contain;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
    width: 24px; /* 图标宽度 */
    height: 24px; /* 图标高度 */
    opacity: 0 !important;
}

#top-settings-holder:hover .drawer-icon,#table_drawer_icon::before {
    opacity: 1 !important;
}

.drawer-icon.fa-fw:hover {
    transform: scale(1.2); 
    opacity: 1 !important; 
}


/* AI响应配置 */
.drawer-icon.fa-sliders {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXBaf.png'); 
}

/* API连接 */
.drawer-icon.fa-plug {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXIZ7.png'); 
}

/* AI回复格式化 */
.drawer-icon.fa-font {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXBaf.png'); 
}

/* 世界书信息 */
.drawer-icon.fa-book-atlas {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXIZ7.png'); 
}

/* 美化主题设置 */
#user-settings-button .drawer-icon {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXBaf.png'); 
}

/* 背景图 */
#backgrounds-drawer-toggle .drawer-icon,
#logo_block .drawer-icon {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXIZ7.png'); 
}

 /* 扩展 */
.drawer-icon.fa-cubes {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXBaf.png');
}

/* 记忆表格 */
.drawer-icon.fa-bars-progress,#table_drawer_icon::before {
    visibility: visible !important;
    display: block !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXIZ7.png') !important; 
}

/* 用户角色管理 */
.drawer-icon.fa-face-smile {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXBaf.png'); 
}

/* 角色卡 */
.drawer-icon.fa-address-card {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJXIZ7.png'); 
}


/* 隐藏滚动条 */
::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
}



/* 1.气泡层 */
.mes {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 0;
  background-attachment: local; 
  transition: transform 0.2s ease; 
  transform-origin: top center;
  max-width: 400px;/*💽气泡层大小，也就是适配手机的尺寸大小，自己尝试适配多少px*/
  width:100%;
  margin: 200px auto 20px !important; /*💽历史和最新消息的间缝大小*/
  background-size: 100% auto; /*💿这里同样改尺寸大小，以防万一*/
  padding-top: 0px !important; 
  padding-bottom: 30px !important; 
  transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg) !important;
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qBcDwTg.png'); 
  background-repeat: repeat-y;
  background-position: top center;
  overflow: visible;
  border: 0 !important;
  outline: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important; 
}

/*上层装饰层 */
.mes::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 400px !important ;/*💽装饰层尺寸大小，解释和上面气泡层尺寸一样*/
  max-width: none !important;
  height: 300px;
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qBUvH8u.png');
  background-size: 100% auto; 
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-position: center top;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 1 !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  top: -180px !important; /*💽上下*/
}

/*下层装饰层*/
.mes::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 400px !important; /* 💽装饰层尺寸 */
  max-width: none !important;
  height: 250px;
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qBcZjcP.png');
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-size: 100% auto; 
  background-position: center bottom;
  z-index: 1;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  bottom: -20px !important;  /*💽上下*/
}


/* ========头像与头像框========= */
/* 头像容器位置 */
.mesAvatarWrapper {
    position: absolute !important;
    top: -136.3px !important;    /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: 62.4% !important;   /* 💽左右微调 */
    transform: translateX(-50%) !important;
    width: auto !important;
    height: auto !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    z-index: 3 !important;
    overflow: visible !important;
    filter: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
}

/* 头像本体 */
.mesAvatarWrapper .avatar {
    width: 100px;  
    height: 100px;
    transform: scale(3.04) rotate(0deg) !important; /* 💽缩放与旋转 */
    transform-origin: center center !important;
    max-width: unset !important;
    max-height: unset !important;
    clip-path: polygon(0 25%, 93.5% 25%, 93.5% 75%, 0 75%);
    opacity: 1 !important;
}


.mesAvatarWrapper .avatar {
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
        to right,
        rgba(0,0,0,1) 0%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 5%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 35%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 85%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%
    );
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
        to right,
        rgba(0,0,0,1) 0%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 5%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 35%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 85%,
        rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%
    );
}



.mesAvatarWrapper .avatar img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: none !important;
}

/* 头像框 */
.mesAvatarWrapper::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top:177% !important;   /* 💽上下 */
    left: 50% !important;  /* 💽左右 */
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 100% !important;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(3.9) rotate(0deg) !important; /* 💽改scale缩小放大 */
    background-image: url('');
    background-size: contain !important;
    background-position: center center !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 3;
}

/* .2.名字与时间戳 */
/*必要的前置*/
.mes_block {
    position: relative !important;
    overflow: visible !important; 
    margin-top: 0px; 
    z-index: 10 !important;
}

/* 💽名字 */
.name_text {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 10;
    bottom: -27px !important;      /* 💽上下微调 */
    left:26% !important;       
    transform: translate(-0%,-0%) rotate(0deg) !important; 
    width: auto !important;
    text-align: center !important; 
    font-size: 12px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    color: #724D20 !important; /* 颜色 */
    opacity: 1 !important;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #ffffff !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.name_text::before {
    content: '撰稿人：'; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left:-2px;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.name_text::after {
    content: ''; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 2px;
    pointer-events: none;
}


/* 💽时间戳 */
.timestamp {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 10;
    top:-0.5px !important;      /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: 41.5% !important;       
    transform: translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(0deg) !important; 
    width: auto !important;
    text-align: center !important; 
    font-size: 9px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    color: #724D20 !important; /* 颜色 */
    opacity: 1 !important;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #000 !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.timestamp::before {
    content: '日報';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.timestamp::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0px;
}

/* 3. 三元素信息 (楼层、计时、词符) */
/* 楼层数 */
.mesIDDisplay {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
    top: -7px !important;      /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: -140% !important;        /* 💽左右微调*/
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg) !important; 
    width: auto !important;
    text-align: center !important; 
    font-size: 10px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    color: #724D20 !important; /* 颜色 */
    opacity: 1 !important;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #ffffff !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    pointer-events: none;
}



.mesIDDisplay::before {
    content: ''; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.mesIDDisplay::after {
    content: ''; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 5px;
}

/* 回复计时 */
.mes_timer {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
    top: 131px !important;      /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: 145px !important;       
    transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(0deg) !important; 
    width: auto !important;
    text-align: center !important; 
    font-size: 9px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    color: #724D20 !important; /* 颜色 */
    opacity: 1 !important;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #ffffff !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.mes_timer::before {
    content: '手写'; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.mes_timer::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 2px;
}

/* 词符数 */
.tokenCounterDisplay {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
    top: 131px !important;     /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: 72px !important;    /* 💽左右微调 */
    transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(0deg);
    font-size: 9px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    color: #724D20 !important; 
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #ffffff !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    white-space: nowrap;
    opacity: 1 !important;
}

.tokenCounterDisplay::before {
    content: '当稿字数';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.tokenCounterDisplay::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0px;
}

/* 4. 操作按钮 (小铅笔、复制等 - 平时状态) */
.mes_buttons {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 9;
    top: 15px !important;      /* 💽上下位置 */
    right: 15px !important;    /* 💽左右位置 */
    transform:  rotate(0deg) !important; 
    display: flex;             
    flex-direction: row;       
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;         
}

.mes[typing="true"] .mes_buttons {
    display: none !important;
    opacity: 0 !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
}

.mes_buttons > div,
.mes_buttons button {
    opacity: 1 !important;
    visibility: visible !important;
}

.mes_buttons[style*="display: none"],
.mes_buttons[style*="display:none"] {
    display: none !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
}


/* 编辑状态菜单 */
.mes_edit_buttons {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 15;
    top: 5px !important;      
    right: 30px !important;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0px;        
    opacity: 1 !important; 
    display: none; 
}

.mes_button, .extraMesButtons>div {
cursor: pointer;
    opacity:0.1 ;
    color: #fff !important;
opacity: 0.7 !important; 
}

/* 去除编辑、删除、重生成等按钮的阴影和发光 */
.mes_buttons div, 
.mes_edit,
.mes_text_paste {
    text-shadow: none !important;  
    box-shadow: none !important;   
    filter: none !important;       
}

.mes_buttons div:hover,
.mes_edit:hover {
    text-shadow: none !important;
}


.mes_buttons,
.mes .mes_buttons,
.mes:hover .mes_buttons {
    opacity: 1 !important;
}


/* -5. 文本框主体 - */
.mes_text {
    position: relative !important;
    padding-top: 15px !important;    /* 💽加大数值=文字下移，减小=文字上移 */
    margin-top: 0px !important;/*💿解除下移限制*/
    padding-bottom: 0px !important; /* 💽底部留白 */
    padding-left: 98px !important;   /* 💽左侧留白 */
    padding-right: 25px !important; /* 💽右侧留白 */
    min-height: 0px !important;  
    text-align: justify; 
    z-index: 2 !important; 
    text-justify: inter-word;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    word-break: break-word;
    line-height: 1.6;
}


/*杂七杂八的东西*/
.mesIDDisplay, .mes_timer, .tokenCounterDisplay, .name_text, .timestamp {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 20 !important;
    width: auto !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    pointer-events: none; 
}


/* 自定义图标 - 编辑按钮 (小铅笔) */
.fa-pencil::before,
.fa-pencil-alt::before {
  display: inline-block !important;
  width: 20px !important;
  height: 20px !important;
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJk3OJ.png') !important;
  background-size: contain !important;
  background-position: center center !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  vertical-align: middle !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  content: '' !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  transition: none !important;
}

/* 自定义图标 - 菜单按钮 (省略号) */
.fa-ellipsis::before,
.fa-ellipsis-h::before {
  display: inline-block !important;
  width: 20px !important;
  height: 20px !important;
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qnJeVMN.png') !important;
  background-size: contain !important;
  background-position: center center !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  vertical-align: middle !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  content: '' !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  transition: none !important;
}


/* 修复小铅笔/省略号*/
.mes_buttons, 
.mes_edit_buttons,
.mes_buttons *, 
.mes_edit_buttons *,
.mes_buttons div, 
.mes_edit_buttons button {
    text-shadow: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
}

/* 底栏容器 */
#send_form {
    display: block !important; 
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    position: relative !important;
    z-index: 50 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    padding: 6px 6px 6px 6px !important; 
    overflow: visible !important;
    height: auto !important; 
}

#send_form > * {
    transform: translateY(3px) !important; 
}

/* 背景层 */
#send_form::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute !important;
    top: 0px !important; 
    left: 0 !important; 
    right: 0 !important; 
    bottom: 0 !important;
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/qzo9vZN.png') !important;
    background-size: cover !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    backdrop-filter: blur(0px) !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0px) !important;
    z-index: -2 !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
}

/* 底栏装饰层 */
#send_form::after {
    content: "" !important;
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: -1 !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
    left: 0 !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 60px !important;
    top: -72px !important;
    background-image: url('') !important;
    background-size: contain !important;
    transform: scale(1.5) !important; 
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center bottom !important;
}

/* 输入框本体 */
#send_textarea {
    clip-path: none !important; 
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    line-height: 26px !important;
    resize: none !important;      
    background-color: transparent !important; 
    color: #724D20 !important; 
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease !important;
    border: 0px solid #6b4a31 !important; 
    box-shadow: inset 1px 2px 4px rgba(40, 20, 0, 0.15) !important; 
    border-radius: 4px !important; 
    padding: 4px 8px !important; 
    margin: 0 !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 36px !important; 
    min-height: 36px !important;
    max-height: 36px !important; 
    overflow-y: auto !important;
}

/* 交互状态：聚焦时*/
#send_textarea:focus {
    background-color: transparent !important; 
    border-color: #724D20 !important;
    box-shadow: inset 1px 2px 4px rgba(40, 20, 0, 0.2), 0 0 5px rgba(166, 123, 91, 0.3) !important; 
    outline: none !important;
}

/* 移除底栏所有焦点外框 */
#send_form,
#send_form:focus,
#send_form:focus-within,
#send_form *:focus {
    outline: none !important;
    border: none !important;
}

/* 安卓点击高亮 */
textarea,
form {
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important;
}


/* 提示词样式 */
#send_textarea::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) !important;
}


/*底栏图标*/
#send_form [class*="fa-"]::before {
  content: '' !important;
  display: inline-block;
  width: 24px; /* 图片宽度 */
  height: 24px; /* 图片高度 */
  background-size: contain;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-position: center;
  vertical-align: middle;
}

/* 菜单 */
#options_button::before {
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIAadve.png') !important;
}

/* 扩展 */
#extensionsMenuButton::before {
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIAhdIS.png') !important;
}

/* 发送 */
#send_but::before {
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIAwOI2.png') !important;
}

/* 停止 */
#mes_stop i::before {
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIANQ9f.png') !important;
}


/* 翻页键 */
.fa-chevron-left,
.fa-chevron-right {
    position: relative !important;
    z-index: 50 !important;
    pointer-events: auto !important;
}

/*翻页计数*/
.swipes-counter {
  transform: translate(-190px, 0px) !important; /* 左右 上下*/
  opacity: 0.45 !important;
  color: #fff !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
}


/*--ui界面--*/
/*世界书界面*/
#world_popup {
    background-image: none !important;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) !important; 
    backdrop-filter: blur(1px) !important; 
    border: 1px solid rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.05) !important; 
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.1) !important; 
    border-radius: 8px !important; 
}


.wi-card-entry {
  border-radius: 0px !important; 
  padding: 24px;
}


/*主题界面*/
.drawer-content.openDrawer{
border-radius: 0px !important; 
}


/* 滑动块项 */
/* --- 1. 滑动条轨道 (背景条) --- */
input[type='range'] {
    box-shadow: none !important;
    filter: none !important;
    background-color: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.8) !important; 
    border-radius: 15px 15px 15px 15px !important;
}

/* --- 2. 滑动块按钮 (那个拖动的小方块) --- */
input[type='range']::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none !important;
    appearance: none !important;
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIAadve.png') !important; 
    background-size: contain !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-color: transparent !important; 
    height: 22px !important;
    width: 22px !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    border: none !important;
    opacity: 1 !important; 
    margin-top: 0px !important; 
    position: relative !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
}


/* 滑动块下方数值框 */
.drawer-content input[type="number"],
.inline-drawer-content input[type="number"],
input[type="number"].text_pole {
    border-radius: 8px 8px 8px 8px !important;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.45) !important;
    filter: none !important;
    outline: none !important;
    background-color: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.2) !important; /* 背景色 */
    color: #724D20 !important; /* 字体颜色 */
    border: 0px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) !important;
    padding: 2px 5px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    text-shadow: none !important;
}

/*未点击时滑动块*/
.drawer-content input[type="number"]:focus,
.inline-drawer-content input[type="number"]:focus {
    box-shadow: none !important;
    border-color: #724D20 !important; 
}


/*编辑框 & 下拉框样式*/
input[type="text"],
input[type="search"],
input[type="password"],
input[type="url"],
textarea:not(#send_textarea) {
    background-color: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.25) !important;
    color: #724D20 !important;  /*颜色*/
    border: 0px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) !important;  /*颜色*/
    border-radius: 5px !important;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.35) !important;
    text-shadow: none !important;
    filter: none !important;
    outline: none !important;
    appearance: none !important;
}

/* --- 输入框获得焦点时 (点击打字时) --- */
input[type="text"]:focus,
input[type="search"]:focus,
input[type="password"]:focus,
input[type="url"]:focus,
textarea:not(#send_textarea):focus {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) !important;
    border-color: #724D20 !important;  /*颜色*/
    box-shadow: none !important;
    outline: none !important;
}

/* --- 修改提示占位文字 --- */
::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) !important; 
    opacity: 1 !important;
    text-shadow: none !important;
}

/* --- 2. 选项下拉框 --- */
select {
    background-color: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.15) !important;
    color: #724D20 !important;  
    border: 1px solid rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.25) !important;  
    border-radius: 15px 15px 15px 15px !important; 
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.65) !important;
    text-shadow: none !important;
    filter: none !important;
    outline: none !important;
}

/*世界书下拉框-针对新版本chrome*/
select option {
    color: #724D20 !important;  /*颜色*/
}

select:hover {
    background-color: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.15) !important;
}



/* 自定义勾选框 */
input[type="checkbox"] {
    -webkit-appearance: none !important;
    appearance: none !important;
    width: 16px !important;
    height: 16px !important;
    border: 1px solid #724D20 !important;  /*颜色*/
    border-radius: 0px !important;
    background-color: transparent !important; 
    box-shadow: none !important;
    filter: none !important;
    outline: none !important;
}

/* --- 选中状态 (打勾时的样式) --- */
input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIAadve.png');
    background-size: 90% !important; 
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-color: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.45) !important;   /*颜色已勾选的框内底色*/
    border-color: #724D20 !important;
}

input[type="checkbox"]::before,
input[type="checkbox"]::after {
    display: none !important;
    content: none !important;
}


/*大标题选项那种*/
#extensions_settings .inline-drawer-toggle.inline-drawer-header, #extensions_settings2 .inline-drawer-toggle.inline-drawer-header, #user-settings-block h4, .standoutHeader{
border-radius: 10px !important; 
background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.1));  /*颜色*/
    box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.65) !important;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 2px 5px;
    border: 2px solid var(--SmartThemeBorderColor);
    transition: all var(--animation-duration-2x);
}



/*正则*/
#saved_regex_scripts,
#saved_scoped_scripts,
#saved_preset_scripts,
#global-script-list,
#character-script-list {
  margin-right: 80px !important;
}


/*ui背景*/
.drawer-content, 
#character_popup, 
#options ,
#select_chat_popup,
#extensionsMenu {
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIA4Xbn.jpg') !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center center !important;
    background-size: cover !important;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 5px 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) !important;
}
/*--ui界面--*/



/* 预设提示词管理器 - 复古贴纸风 */
ul#completion_prompt_manager_list.text_pole.ui-sortable {
    border-radius: 2px !important;
    background-color: #BD9871 !important; 
    border: 1px solid #724D20 !important;  
    padding: 16px !important;
    box-shadow: -4px 4px 0px rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.15) !important; 
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
}

/* 2. 已启用提示词 (贴纸效果 & 左下阴影) */
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt:not(.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled) {
    border-radius: 0px !important;
    background-color: #BD9871 !important;  
    background-image: none !important;
    border: 1px solid #724D20 !important;
    margin-bottom: 12px !important;
    color: #724D20 !important;                      
    box-shadow: -5px 5px 0px #724D20 !important; 
    transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease !important;
}

/* 悬停效果 - 已启用 (轻微浮起) */
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt:not(.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled):hover {
    transform: translate(1px, -1px) !important;
    box-shadow: -6px 6px 0px #724D20 !important;
    background-color: #BD9871 !important;
}

/* 按压效果 - 已启用 (点击时) */
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt:not(.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled):active {
    transform: translate(-3px, 3px) !important;
    box-shadow: -2px 2px 0px #724D20 !important;
    background-color: #F8F1E5 !important;
}

/* 3. 未启用/禁用提示词 (无效果、无边框) */
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled {
    border-radius: 0px !important;
    background: transparent !important; 
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
    border: none !important; 
    border-left: 4px solid transparent !important; /* 预留边框宽度防跳动 */
    margin-bottom: 12px !important;
    color: #B59F84 !important;                
    opacity: 0.8 !important;                  
    box-shadow: none !important;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease !important;
}

/* 悬停效果 - 未启用 (仅改变底色) */
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled:hover {
    background: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.45) !important;
    color: #724D20 !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
}

/* 点击效果 - 未启用 (仅保留左侧竖边) */
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled:active {
    border-left: 4px solid #724D20 !important;
    background: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.1) !important;
}

/* 4. 修正内部文字 */
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt span {
    text-shadow: none !important; 
    font-weight: bold !important;
    letter-spacing: 1px !important;
}

/* 未启用提示词文字改色 */
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled,
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled * {
    color: #724D20 !important; 
    text-shadow: none !important;
}

.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled:hover *,
.completion_prompt_manager_prompt_disabled:active * {
    color: #724D20 !important;
}

/* 5. 顶部标题栏 */
#completion_prompt_manager > div > div.completion_prompt_manager_header > div.completion_prompt_manager_header_advanced > span ,
#completion_prompt_manager > div > div.completion_prompt_manager_header > div:nth-child(2) > span,
#completion_prompt_manager > div > div.completion_prompt_manager_header > div:nth-child(2)  {
    color: #724D20 !important; 
    font-weight: bold !important;
    letter-spacing: 2px !important;
    padding-bottom: 4px !important;
    margin-bottom: 6px !important;
    }


/* 预设提示词管理器-end */

/* 文本 */
/* 双引号文本 */
q {
    all: unset !important; 
    display: inline !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.4) !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
}

/* 2. 斜体文本  */
em, .mes_text em {
    all: unset !important;
    display: inline !important;
    font-style: italic !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.4) !important;
}

/* 3. 代码块 */
.mes_text pre code {
    background: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.1) !important;
    border: none !important;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.3) !important;
    border-radius: 0px !important;
    text-shadow: none !important; 
    Color:#724D20;
}

/* 4. 引用框架 - 移除阴影和背景图 */
.mes_text blockquote {
    background: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.15) !important;
    border: none !important;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.2) !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    text-shadow: none !important;
    padding: 4px 12px !important;
    margin: 8px 0 !important;
}

/* 5. 分割线 - 极细半透明线 */
.mes_text hr {
    border: none !important;
    height: 1px !important;
    background: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.7) !important;
    margin: 20px 0 !important;
}



/*隐藏输入框原身文字*/
#send_textarea::placeholder {
    color: transparent !important;
    text-shadow: none !important;
}

/*输入框自定义文案*/
#nonQRFormItems:has(#send_textarea:placeholder-shown)::before {
    content: ""; /* ✒️""内自定义文案 */
    color: #fff; 
    opacity: 0.5;
    position: absolute; 
    left: 55%;/*💽左右*/
    top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%); 
    font-style: oblique; 
    font-size: 0.5em;  
    pointer-events: none; 
    z-index: 10; 
    white-space: nowrap; 
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    max-width: calc(100% - 30px); 
}


/*思维链*/
.mes_reasoning_header {
  position:absolute !important;
  background: transparent !important; 
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIaB5QI.png') !important;
  background-size: contain !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  background-position: center !important;
  height: 40px !important;    
  min-width: 40px !important;
  padding: 0 15px !important;  
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center !important; 
  justify-content: center !important; 
  top: -42px; /*💿上下*/
  left: 64px; /*💿左右*/
  z-index: 10;
  transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out !important;
}

.mes_reasoning_summary:hover .mes_reasoning_header {
  transform: scale(1) !important; 
  background-color: transparent !important; 
  border-color: transparent !important; 
  filter: brightness(1.1); 
}


/* 自定义思维链文案 */
.mes_reasoning_header_title {
  font-size: 0 !important;
}

.mes_reasoning_header_title::before {
  content: ''; /* 文案 */
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #fff !important;   /* 字体颜色 */
  font-weight: 600; 
  letter-spacing: 1px; 
  position: relative;
  top: 0px;   /* 向下移填正数，向上移填负数  */
  left: 0px;  /* 向右移填正数，向左移填负数 */
}

/* 箭头部分 - 保持隐藏 */
.mes_reasoning_arrow {
  font-size: 0 !important;
}
.mes_reasoning_arrow::before {
  content: '';
  display: none !important;
}

/* 箭头部分 - 保持隐藏 */
.mes_reasoning_arrow {
  font-size: 0 !important;
}
.mes_reasoning_arrow::before {
  content: ''; 
  display: none !important; 
}

/* 思维链容器 */
.mes_reasoning {
  z-index: 10;
  background: rgba(114, 77, 32, 0.25) !important; 
  Color:#724D20;
  margin-top: 20px !important; 
  border-left: none !important; 
  margin-left: 17.5px !important;
  width: calc(100% - 15px) !important;
  max-height: 200px !important; 
  overflow-y: auto !important;  
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 15px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255 , 0.25) !important;
  border-radius: 10px !important;
  padding: 15px !important; 
}

/* 思维链编辑按钮位置 */
.mes_reasoning_actions {
  position: absolute !important;
  right: 100px !important;
  top: 0px !important;
}

/* 编辑框样式 */
.reasoning_edit_textarea {
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 200px !important;   
    min-height: 10px !important; 
    position: relative !important; 
    margin: 30px auto !important; 
    left: 10px !important;        
    top: 0px !important;
}


/* 定义动画关键帧：左上 -> 右下 */
@keyframes float-diagonal {
    0% {
        transform: translate(-5px, -5px); 
    }
    100% {
        transform: translate(5px, 5px);  
    }
}

/*加载齿轮*/
#load-spinner {
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/qIaB5QI.png') !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-size: contain !important;
    animation: float-diagonal 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate !important;
    transition: none !important; 
    border: none !important;
    border-radius: 0 !important;
    width: 84px !important;
    height: 84px !important;
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    justify-content: center !important;
}

#load-spinner > * {
    display: none !important;
}

#load-spinner::before,
#load-spinner::after {
    display: none !important;
    animation: none !important;
}

/*--杂七杂八的东西x2--*/
/* 强制移除省略号和小铅笔图标的所有阴影效果 */
.fa-ellipsis-h::before,
.fa-ellipsis::before,
.fa-pencil-alt::before,
.fa-pencil::before,
.mes_buttons button,
.mes_edit_buttons button,
.mes_buttons button:hover,
.mes_edit_buttons button:hover {
    box-shadow: none !important;
    text-shadow: none !important;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent) !important;
    -webkit-filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent) !important;
    outline: none !important;
    border: none !important;
    background-color: transparent !important;
}
